{
  "job_B9.2.5_20251003_114956": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00fe\u00e6m fleame Hasterbal wear\u00f0 ofslagen from his agnum folce. \u00dea w\u00e6ron Cartainiense swa ofercumene & swa gedrefde betux him selfum, \u00fe\u00e6t hie hie to nanum \u00dea sendon hie Regulus \u00feone consul, \u00feone hie h\u00e6fdon mid him fif winter on bendum, & he him & he hit swa gel\u00e6ste, & abead \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6g\u00feer \u00feara folca o\u00ferum ageafe ealle \u00fea men \u00fee hie gehergead & \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee he hit aboden h\u00e6fde, he hie healsade \u00fe\u00e6t hie nanuht \u00feara \u00e6renda ne underfenge, \u00dea \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6m wordum hie budon him \u00fe\u00e6t he on cy\u00fe\u00fee mid him wunade, & to his rice fenge. \u00dea ondwyrde he him, & cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t hit na geweor\u00fean sceolde \u00fe\u00e6t se w\u00e6re leoda cyning se \u00fee \u00e6r \u00dea he eft to Cartainum com, \u00fea as\u00e6don his geferan hu he heora \u00e6renda abead. \u00dea forcurfon hie him \u00fea twa \u00e6dran on twa healfa \u00feara eagena, \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6m slapan ne mehte, \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Atilius Regulus & Mallius Ulsca \u00fea consulas foron on Cartaine, on Libeum \u00fe\u00e6t igland, \u00dea befor hiene \u00fe\u00e6r Hannibal se geonga cyning, Amilcores sunu, \u00fe\u00e6r hie ungearwe butan f\u00e6stenne \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Claudius se consul for eft an Punice. & him Hannibal ut on s\u00e6 ongean com, & ealle ofslog buton XXX sciphl\u00e6sta: \u00fea o\u00f0flugon to \u00de\u00e6r w\u00e6s ofslagen IX M, & XX M gefangen. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m for Gaius Iunius se consul",
